Chapter: ApproxEqArm
  cites Gpu chapter DeviceEffect

 We say:

Section: Kernels

  ae-flags : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  ae-flags (xb) (zb) (yb) (gid) = act
    x <- device-load-f32 xb gid
    z <- device-load-f32 zb gid
    device-store yb gid ((if x ~0 z then 1 else 0) + (if x ~ z then 2 else 0))
  end
